# Agent skills (BaleMed)

This repo ships project skills under `.cursor/skills/`. For pstack and context7,
see the global routing in `lean-engineering-skills.mdc` and the `smart-coder` skill.

## Auto routing

Follow `.cursor/rules/auto-skill-routing.mdc`. Agent picks skills from context — no `/skill-name` needed.
For coding tasks, the `smart-coder` skill is the primary entry point.

